      "role": "user",
      "content": "but those tiny variables don't actually change the math. if the sum of existence is zero, then choosing to end it is just a neutral move. it's not even \"bad,\" it's just a logical exit from a system that offers no net gain. if it's all neutral, why is there such a big stigma against just choosing to leave?",
